sect1.sect2:
    Preparing for the NVIDIA Installation

    &nvidia-common-kernel;



      Extract the NVIDIA driver runfile and
      navigate to the extracted directory:


sh NVIDIA-Linux-x86_64-&nvidia-version;.run -x &&
cd NVIDIA-Linux-x86_64-&nvidia-version;

Installation of the NVIDIA Kernel Modules
Change into the kernel-open directory:
cd kernel-open
&nvidia-common-build-modules;
Install the firmware as the &root; user:
rm -rvf /usr/lib/firmware/nvidia/[0-9]* && mkdir -pv /usr/lib/firmware/nvidia/&nvidia-version; && cp -v firmware/*.bin /usr/lib/firmware/nvidia/&nvidia-version;

